@host = http://localhost:8080

### Service descriptor
GET {{host}}/

### Readiness — degraded above 90% queue depth
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Ingest counters
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ingest/stats

### Push a batch. One of each kind, so all three union branches are exercised.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "readings": [
    { "site": "bench", "dev": "esp32-bench-01", "sig": "soil_moisture", "v": 42.7, "ts": 0, "seq": 1, "k": "Float" },
    { "site": "bench", "dev": "esp32-bench-01", "sig": "power_watts",   "v": 231,  "seq": 2 },
    { "site": "bench", "dev": "esp32-bench-01", "sig": "valve_open",    "v": true, "seq": 3 }
  ]
}

### Type violation. Expect 202 with one rejection carrying code "type_mismatch" —
### the gateway does not convert true into 1.0.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "readings": [
    { "site": "bench", "dev": "esp32-bench-01", "sig": "soil_moisture", "v": true, "seq": 4 }
  ]
}

### Quoted number. Expect 400: a device sending "42" is a firmware bug, not a value to parse.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "readings": [
    { "site": "bench", "dev": "esp32-bench-01", "sig": "soil_moisture", "v": "42", "seq": 5 }
  ]
}

### Read the window back
GET {{host}}/api/v1/telemetry/bench/esp32-bench-01/soil_moisture?max=50

### Every signal the gateway has seen
GET {{host}}/api/v1/telemetry/signals

### Fleet tier
GET {{host}}/api/v1/fleet/summary

### Devices at one site
GET {{host}}/api/v1/devices?site=site-00

### Arm a spike so the PR-3 scorer has something to find
POST {{host}}/api/v1/seed/fault
Content-Type: application/json

{ "class": "Spike", "durationMs": 20000, "magnitude": 9 }

### Correlated outage — the load-shedding case that must collapse to one event
POST {{host}}/api/v1/seed/fault
Content-Type: application/json

{ "class": "SiteWideOutage", "site": "site-01", "durationMs": 30000 }

### Drive the queue into backpressure
POST {{host}}/api/v1/seed/fault
Content-Type: application/json

{ "class": "Flood", "durationMs": 15000, "magnitude": 200 }

### Deliverable 2 — expect 501 with plannedIn: PR-5
GET {{host}}/api/v1/commands/esp32-bench-01/history

### Deliverable 3 — expect 501 with plannedIn: PR-6
GET {{host}}/api/v1/topology
